# Rust build artifacts — never sync (huge, machine-specific), like .venv.
# Builds are redirected out of Dropbox via .cargo/config.toml, but ignore a
# stray local target/ too just in case.
/target

# Machine-specific build config (absolute, out-of-Dropbox target-dir). Each
# machine copies .cargo/config.toml.example → .cargo/config.toml.
/.cargo/config.toml

# Cargo.lock IS committed (this workspace builds a binary application).
